WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.100
Welcome to the show, we
have a terrific program.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.650
And do I seem excited?

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:09.140
Yes, and for a good reason, I am excited.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.168
I've been waiting for this day.

00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:14.720
We have not had an audience
because of the quarantine,

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.350
COVID, not had real people
here, we're getting close.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:23.150
A couple of days ago, I asked
my fans watching the show

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.890
if they wanted to be part
of our real audience,

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.000
take a picture of
themselves, post it online,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.720
and we would turn them into cutouts

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.940
here at the Largo Theater.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:35.460
Yes, professional sports is
doing it, now we're doing it.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.250
And wallah, look at this,

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.400
we're starting to fill the audience.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.820
Over 15,000 people have contacted us,

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.270
sent us their photographs,

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.220
and we are as fast as we can

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.230
turning them into cardboard cutouts.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.370
Now, it's a process, it's
taking some time, but look,

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.890
we've got a pretty good group
here, this is pretty good.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.530
Yeah, we have our own little village.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:00.560
Yeah, we have an incredible
village of people

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.760
and it's growing.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.820
This is gonna be a packed
house by the next day or so,

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.780
this is amazing what's happening.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:10.350
This is what America can do,

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.440
this is what we should be doing,

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:14.190
not searching for a cure or a vaccine,

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:17.120
making cardboard cutouts of ourselves

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.360
that we can put in audiences.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.757
That's the answer.

00:01:20.757 --> 00:01:21.790
(chuckles)

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:22.830
Hey, look here.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.700
I'm gonna do that on Thanksgiving.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:25.533
Yes.

00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:27.060
No family, just cutouts.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.383
Sure, why should this
year be any different?

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.600
Sorry, Andy, pretty good slam though,

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.930
pretty good slam.
[Andy] It was pretty good.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.280
All right, let's say hello to
some people in our audience,

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.900
and that's Carolina
Avia, got an aisle seat.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.760
She came here early and
she's so happy to see me,

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:46.750
or she hates the sound of my
voice and is covering her ears.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.253
Next to her, well, I think
it's quite clear that,

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.380
that woman is in love with me.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.590
Her name's Taylor Rue Davey,
and she's just smitten,

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.490
and of course upping
the ante, next to her,

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:01.883
Tomasky Manes, clearly having an orgasm,

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:04.760
which is something,

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:08.260
it's a common reaction
to seeing this program.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:11.590
There's a Benjamin Tar,
very patriotic Benjamin Tar.

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.220
Good-looking American right
there, enjoying the show.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:17.923
And next to Benjamin Tar
is a cat named Pablo,

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.835
doesn't seem to be that
thrilled with the show,

00:02:22.835 --> 00:02:26.008
Pablo is waiting for something
funny to happen so far--

00:02:26.008 --> 00:02:27.290
[Andy] More mouse content.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.773
More mouse (laughs), more mouse content,

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.450
that's what Pablo wants,
Andy, I think you're right.

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:38.590
Andy, speaking of which,
who is that next to you?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.310
They seem like a little
afraid of the show.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.900
This is my buddy, Jayden Barns.

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:45.400
Why are you so nervous, Jayden?

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.233
Come on.

00:02:46.233 --> 00:02:48.699
Yeah, well, you're getting
a little handsy with him.

00:02:48.699 --> 00:02:51.380
Yeah, well, I mean, I liked this,

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.593
it's called fan outreach, right Jayden?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.480
Let me, there's a person in the front row.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.660
Let's see if we can spot that guy,

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.620
I think he's wearing a gee.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:03.270
He's got his bare chested and
he's giving me a lot of tude,

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:07.643
that is Ian Oliver, and I
believe he's wearing a gee.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.860
He is dressed for combat,

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:12.080
and he looks like he wants to kick my ass

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.040
right across the street.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.210
[Andy] It might be a bathrobe

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.859
and he might just be a drunk.

00:03:15.859 --> 00:03:17.610
(laughing)

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.650
Back there, Andy, do you see
this person in the final row?

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:21.888
Yeah, the tux.

00:03:21.888 --> 00:03:23.770
And I think this is kind
of yours, Andy, this--

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.320
I saw this guy, yeah, he does...

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:30.320
We are from the same sort of
gene pool of porridge faces.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.100
Who is this gentlemen?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:33.933
What's his name?

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.627
Chris Kabi.

00:03:36.627 --> 00:03:37.488
Chris Kabi?

00:03:37.488 --> 00:03:38.321
[Andy] Chris Kabi.

00:03:38.321 --> 00:03:41.040
Well, I like Chris,
you clean up real nice,

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.890
and I liked that you had
the dignity to wear a tuxedo

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.610
to our show, no one's
done that in 30 years.

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:50.179
He has the Richter family
class, that's for sure.

00:03:50.179 --> 00:03:52.429
(laughing)

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.540
Anyway, this is really exciting.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.860
The audience is starting to fill out,

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:02.830
and I think in the following days,

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:05.960
we're gonna see this
audience completely filled

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.750
with fans of the show who
are excited to be here.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.360
I think we're gonna have a packed house.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.350
We won't be so lonely anymore.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.970
We're not gonna be lonely at all.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.980
The important thing is if you
want to join in all the fun,

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:22.490
go to teamcoco.com/cutouts,
send us your photo.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.520
We'll put you in the crowd.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.220
This is exciting.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.940
This is us bobbing and weaving,

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:32.400
and playing with the situation
that we're in right now, man.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.357
I think Jayden's face
says it all, right, buddy?

00:04:35.357 --> 00:04:37.440
(laughs)

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.580
Yes, you too can be as happy as that guy.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.500
So get in on the phone,
this is just a great way

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.623
to show that we're all in this together.

